SRD 5.1 content (CC-BY-4.0)
---------------------------
This repository includes material taken from the System Reference Document
5.1 ("SRD 5.1"), used under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International License (CC-BY-4.0).

Wizards of the Coast requires the following attribution. It is quoted from
the Legal Information page of the SRD 5.1 CC-BY-4.0 release,
https://media.wizards.com/2023/downloads/dnd/SRD_CC_v5.1.pdf
(the same statement is in
https://www.dndbeyond.com/attachments/39j2li89/SRD5.1-CCBY4.0License.pdf):

This work includes material taken from the System Reference Document 5.1 (“SRD 5.1”) by Wizards of the Coast LLC and available at https://dnd.wizards.com/resources/systems-reference-document. The SRD 5.1 is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License available at https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode.

That attribution covers the SRD-derived material in these paths:

- content/packs/srd51.core/ — authored SRD 5.1 spells, monsters, items, and
  characters (each document's source.ref is "SRD 5.1", license CC-BY-4.0).
  The pack manifest's attribution field carries the statement above.
  content/packs/srd51.core/scripts/ is original behavior code that refers to
  those stat blocks; it is engine code under Apache-2.0.
- content/packs/sample.vertical_slice/characters/ and that pack's manifest
  attribution. The chunk under content/packs/sample.vertical_slice/chunks/
  is an original map, not SRD text.
- tests/compat/fl1/sample.vertical_slice/ — frozen copy of the sample pack,
  including the SRD fighter, the SRD goblin, and the manifest attribution.
- tests/validate/data/srd51_classes_5e_database_a6212be.json
  tests/validate/data/srd51_monsters_5e_database_a6212be.json
  tests/validate/data/srd51_proficiencies_5e_database_a6212be.json
  tests/validate/data/srd51_spells_5e_database_a6212be.json
  — field-level copies of SRD 5.1 data taken from the 5e-database mirror
  at commit a6212be. The mirror's own code is MIT; the SRD data is
  CC-BY-4.0.
- tests/validate/cases/ and tests/validate/fixtures/ — validator specimens
  whose documents set source to SRD 5.1 / CC-BY-4.0 (spells, monsters,
  items, and characters).
- engine/core/tests/fixtures/monster/goblin.v1.json
- engine/core/sim/tests/data/schema_bump_v4/ — SRD-derived character and
  monster fixtures (barbarian, fighter, animated armor, goblin).
- engine/rules/tests/derive_character_srd_cases.inc
  engine/rules/tests/derive_character_srd_item_classes.inc
  engine/rules/tests/derive_monster_srd_cases.inc
  — generated expectations taken from those SRD stat blocks.
- docs/SRD_COMBAT_COVERAGE.md
  docs/SRD_MONSTERS_DEFERRED.md
  docs/SRD_SPELLS_DEFERRED.md
  docs/SRD_CLASSES_DEFERRED.md
  — audits that quote SRD 5.1 material.
- docs/proposals/EQUIPMENT.md
  docs/proposals/FORCED_MOVEMENT.md
  docs/proposals/LARGE_CREATURE_FOOTPRINT_AUDIT.md
  docs/proposals/LIGHTING.md
  docs/proposals/SUMMONS_TRANSFORMS.md
  docs/proposals/VERSION_BUMP_BATCH.md
  docs/proposals/ZONES_AURAS.md
  — design notes that restate SRD 5.1 rules.

Pack manifests already store the same attribution sentence with ASCII
quotation marks, which is how the JSON documents are written. The sentence
in this file uses the quotation marks from the SRD 5.1 PDF.
